&lt;p&gt;作者：&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607523772&quot; alt=&quot;carter lu&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu&quot;  &gt;carter lu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，作者页在&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/carter&quot;&gt;此&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSS改自忘却主题版式&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;感谢&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/onxy&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3258233&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607523772&quot; alt=&quot;ONXY&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3258233)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/onxy&quot;  &gt;ONXY&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;以及&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djpieplus&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6603529&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607523772&quot; alt=&quot;djpieplus&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6603529)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djpieplus&quot;  &gt;djpieplus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的指导与建议。&lt;br /&gt;
